      "note": [
        "Public administration agencies are all the authorities/agencies that are not defense agencies, excluding those called research-financing government agencies (the Swedish Research Council, Formas, Forte and Vinnova).",
        "Correction 2019-04-11. R&D funds concerning 2017 and 2018 for the expenditure areas Justice and Defence and contingency measures has been corrected. This is due to erroneous interpretations of Statistics Sweden´s R&D definitions made by some authorities. The correction affects the forecast for the total sum of R&D in the state budget and thus also all accounting categories.",
        "Between 2004 and 2005 there was a change in the division of recieving units. For data according to the old classification, for 2004 and earlier, see the table GBAORD distributed by socio-economic objectives an by recipient, under the table group Government budget allocations för R&D , older statistics."
